# Harness/profile config -- not secrets, actively read at runtime by every
# tracker adapter (statuses.yaml) and the profile/capability-binding system
# (profile.yaml). Blanket *.yaml above silently swallowed these on the initial
# SAW harness adoption; discovered when scripts/gitea-tracker.sh (which reads
# statuses.yaml as its status-machine source of truth) was added and this repo
# had never actually committed the file a fresh clone would need.
!profiles/*/profile.yaml
!profiles/neutral/adapters/statuses.yaml
!docs/rule-ledger.yaml
backups/*/config/
backups/*/logs/

